From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: herdr-universal-preview <hup@localhost>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 02:07:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] terminal links: Cmd-click on a local file or folder shows
 it in the files-plus panel

file: URLs (OSC 8 from agents) are decoded to paths; the stack holding
files-plus is brought forward and the path is sent as open:/reveal:.
Without a files-plus panel, links open with the system as before.
native.open-link runs the same path for scripts and self-checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

